<tr>
<td><strong>ΧΡΗΣΙΜΕΣ ΠΑΡΟΥΣΙΑΣΕΙΣ</strong></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul style="list-style-type: disc">
<li><span style="color: #3366ff"><a href="https://www.ucy.ac.cy/ir/wp-content/uploads/sites/113/2023/03/ESN-Nicosia-Presentation-2023-UCY.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESN PRESENTATION</a></span></li>
<li><span style="background-color: #ffffff"><a href="https://my.visme.co/view/ep9ygo3m-erasmus-student-network-nicosia-survival-guide?fbclid=IwAR2KJQL7lub5-miUPHzdoyHuLvlyWYTkpiFgM14nN2kO7FCXWNmLGif-dus" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESN SURVIVAL GUIDE &#8211; NEW AND IMPORTANT</a></span></li>
</ul>
